Z||000000||Tina||03-25-2001||02:04 PM||||This is the culprit.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=1315468&a=12269353&p=44744305"> <BR>Seems to have screw attached to in back.<BR>Anyway to get it out, without disasembling whole entire door (I'am halfway there)  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/mad.gif"><P>Reason why.<BR>Need to switch moldings to match 84 nose and rearend going on to 87 coupe.||||reg||8
